            "text": "{\n  \"judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0000\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F001:F006\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The source supports qualifying C0000 with C0001 as an exception. Subparagraph (B)(i) expressly provides that Subparagraph (A) (represented by C0000) shall not apply if the attorney general determines that pre-filing notice is not feasible. The updated fields and summary faithfully reflect the statutory exemption without conflating it with the separate concurrent filing duty in clause (ii).\",\n      \"verdict\": \"supported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0002\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F001:F009\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposal incorrectly sets C0002 as the qualified target of C0001. Subparagraph (B)(i) explicitly exempts the attorney general from Subparagraph (A) (C0000), not the subsequent requirement in clause (ii) (C0002). In addition, it improperly merges the distinct duty of clause (ii) into the summary of C0001.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0001\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F006\", \"F009\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposed summary improperly combines the separate concurrent notification duty of clause (ii) (captured in C0002) into C0001, which governs only the exemption under clause (i).\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
